    Libs/LibDeflate:             https://github.com/SafeteeWoW/LibDeflate
    Libs/HereBeDragons:          https://github.com/Nevcairiel/HereBeDragons
    Libs/LibDBIcon-1.0:          https://repos.wowace.com/wow/libdbicon-1-0/trunk
    Libs/LibWindow-1.1:          https://repos.wowace.com/wow/libwindow-1-1/trunk
    Libs/LibPeriodicTable-3.1:   https://repos.wowace.com/wow/libperiodictable-3-1/trunk/LibPeriodicTable-3.1
